{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1RoZSUyMFdvcmRzJTIwJTI4MjAxMiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Words","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/aJtPLZS7tlpiQl6pEr8H42K565x.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lKZ9QdzMEIceI2PUnFCjZNq1JIg.jpg","description":"The Words follows young writer Rory Jansen who finally achieves long sought after literary success after publishing the next great American novel. There's only one catch - he didn't write it. As the past comes back to haunt him and his literary star continues to rise, Jansen is forced to confront the steep price that must be paid for stealing another man's work, and for placing ambition and success above life's most fundamental three words.","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["Drama","Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.7","runtime":"102 min","cast":["Bradley Cooper","Zoe Saldaña","Jeremy Irons","Dennis Quaid","Olivia Wilde","J.K. Simmons","John Hannah","Željko Ivanek"],"director":["Brian Klugman","Lee Sternthal"],"released":"2012-09-07T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"There's more than one way to take a life.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Bradley Cooper","character":"Rory Jansen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5Dhy50qOMOHfR1NZifKIfffjV9X.jpg"},{"name":"Zoe Saldaña","character":"Dora Jansen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vQBwmsSOAd0JDaEcZ5p43J9xzsY.jpg"},{"name":"Jeremy Irons","character":"The Old Man","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w8Ct1q02Ht3sWdOSqfp3B85TzT.jpg"},{"name":"Dennis Quaid","character":"Clay Hammond","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lMaDAJHzsKH7U3dln2B3kY3rOhE.jpg"},{"name":"Olivia Wilde","character":"Danielle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jYopRE6nhYGqpb64fVUKrbJVMy1.jpg"},{"name":"J.K. Simmons","character":"Mr. Jansen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ScmKoJ9eiSUOthAt1PDNLi8Fkw.jpg"},{"name":"John Hannah","character":"Richard Ford","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/